  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'A WILDERNESS TO SHARE


    No race timer, score or winner. Drive the
    mountain trails to discover lakes, caves, cabins and overlooks. Stop, tap ACTION,
    then use left/right to browse nearby activities and ACTION to choose.


    Gather
    visible sticks, firewood and forage. A campfire needs3sticks and2firewood. Fresh
    fish or forage cooks into2warm meals. At the lake, cast and tap ACTION when the
    bobber dips; missing a bite has no penalty.


    Drive gently up a hammock approach
    until the actual wheels settle on its spring-supported deck, then choose NAP.
    Cabins and rest clearings also allow naps. WAKE returns to exploring.


    PHOTO
    opens a shared scenic camera. The selected owner''s controls orbit, ACTION captures
    a real PNG, and RETURN TO WALK ends the photo. Pause/help freeze the session.
    Save or restore a paused expedition through the existing workshop adapter.


    Survival-lite
    is optional, forgiving hunger/food. No starvation, collision harvesting or compulsory
    leaderboard. Companions actually drive, gather, cook, fish and relax.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
